The bus goes through Mumbai's traffic.
There are many vehicles on the road.
I look out the window.
After a while, the bus stops.
There is a big station in front.
It is a metro station.
The station has big glass doors.
I step down from the bus.
I get off carefully.
There is a very big crowd outside.
All the people are walking towards the station.
I also walk in that crowd.
I need to go by metro today.
I need to go inside the station.
The entrance is very near.
I walk fast.
I enter the station.
